σ / S ^ (3 / 2) ≤ CausalSmith.Stat.RdTruesideNoiseFrontier.rateResolution β n σ ∧ CausalSmith.Stat.RdTruesideNoiseFrontier.rateResolution β n σ ≤ A ^ (3 / 2) * (σ / S ^ (3 / 2))

